                                "sense_id": "21a3bd6e-6ca7-39a9-a302-c90ae6209f11",
                                "text": "He looked for his enamel chamber pot — or poe in local parlance — whose better days had long gone: the handle was broken, there were a few rusted holes, and it was covered with a myriad of spalls. The poison of the fish soon had him vomiting in the poe."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
